//! The Win32 frame and editor window: the double-buffered paint pipeline and
//! the window procedures over the platform-neutral `Editor` state.

// This module is a thin FFI layer: every function is an
// `unsafe fn` whose body is Win32 interop over raw handles
// and pointers, so the `unsafe fn` boundary itself is the
// safety contract. The per-call `unsafe` blocks that the
// 2024 `unsafe_op_in_unsafe_fn` lint asks for are elided
// here for readability.
#![allow(unsafe_op_in_unsafe_fn)]

