/// 高级排序 (cm_tool_sort, 1652, Ctrl+F9) asks for its options in a popup the frame
/// builds, and the rows both choose and run: 按照字母/数字/长度 is which comparison
/// the rows are put in, and 排序到新文档 is where the answer is written.
const SORT_MENU: u32 = 322;
